&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Contessa 32 &amp;lsquo;Lucy&amp;rsquo; – A Sailing Yacht with Charm and Tradition
 &lt;div id="contessa-32-lucy--a-sailing-yacht-with-charm-and-tradition" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#contessa-32-lucy--a-sailing-yacht-with-charm-and-tradition" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Contessa 32&lt;/strong&gt;, designed by David Sadler and built by Jeremy Rogers Ltd, strikes a balance between classic long keel boats and modern fin keel boats. Its semi-long keel with skeg design, inspired by the Contessa 26, offers efficient upwind performance and exceptional seaworthiness. The Contessa 32, renowned for its stability and practical interior layout, is a popular choice for sailors prioritizing comfort and performance at sea.&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://lucy.hamburg/lucy/boot/featured.jpeg"/></item><item><title>Skipper</title><link>https://lucy.hamburg/en/lucy/sailing/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://lucy.hamburg/en/lucy/sailing/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;
